  "description": "EU AI Act compliance toolkit. Article 6 risk classifier (prohibited / high-risk / limited / minimal), Article 26(9) FRIA generator for deployers, Article 50 transparency obligations checker, and HMAC-signed compliance attestations. Built for the Aug 2026 / Dec 2027 cliff dates after the Digital Omnibus delays.",
